# Gercek Windows girdisi: taslak secimleri, bir Begin ve asil projeyi End.
# Uc75 saniyelik pencere icin root PlayerTimeoutSeconds300 kullanir.
# Script reform draft/begin/end komutu gondermez; stok veya adim yazmaz.
new
lang ru
select normandy
panel reform
expect Week 0
expect Gold 840
expect Food 360
expect Power 55
expect Troops 1200
expect Manpower 2400
expect MilitarySupplies 120
expect SelectedRegionId normandy
expect SelectedUnrest 30
expect SelectedControl 80
expect HasRegionalReform False
expect ReformStatus closed
remember unmodified-draft
state 00-start
shot 00-start

# Pencere1: root commerce sonra provisioning dugmelerine gercek tiklar.
# Her iki ara kare root tarafindan gorulmeli; yalniz finalstate bu gecisleri kanitlamaz.
wait 75
same unmodified-draft
expect HasRegionalReform False
expect ReformStatus closed
expect Week 0
state 01-native-drafts-only
shot 01-native-drafts-only

# Pencere2: root document sonuna kaydirir ve provisioning icin Begin'e bir kez tiklar.
wait 75
expect Week 0
expect Gold 720
expect Food 360
expect Power 51
expect Troops 1200
expect Manpower 2400
expect MilitarySupplies 120
expect HasRegionalReform True
expect ReformStatus pending
expect ReformRegionId normandy
expect ReformModeId provisioning
expect ReformStepsRemaining 4
expect SelectedRegionId normandy
expect Moves 2
expect Fatigue 0
expect BattleActive False
expect ResolvedBattleCount 0
state 02-native-paid-pending
shot 02-native-paid-pending

# Sonraki pencere oncesi normal harita secimi; proje Normandy'de kalir.
select brittany
panel reform
scroll document 0
expect SelectedRegionId brittany
expect ReformRegionId normandy
expect ReformModeId provisioning
expect ReformStepsRemaining 4
state 03-original-region-after-selection
shot 03-original-region-after-selection

# Pencere3: root asil Normandy projesini belge altindaki End ile iptal eder.
wait 75
expect Week 0
expect Gold 720
expect Food 360
expect Power 51
expect Troops 1200
expect Manpower 2400
expect MilitarySupplies 120
expect Moves 2
expect Fatigue 0
expect SelectedRegionId brittany
expect HasRegionalReform False
expect ReformStatus closed
expect ReformStepsRemaining 0
expect PendingPetition False
expect BattleActive False
expect ResolvedBattleCount 0
state 04-native-original-project-ended
shot 04-native-original-project-ended
remember native-ended
save
load
same native-ended
state 05-ended-loaded
shot 05-ended-loaded
quit
